 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychedelic hyper-speed racer with no speed limit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pilot an insanely fast ship  around a cosmic cylinder. There's no speed limit - only your ability to stay focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No brakes. No speed limit.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about slowing down. It's about going faster. There are no brakes. Brakes are boring. <br><br>But there is a boost button. It's free to use, and it's always on the table. <br><br>Going faster isn't a punishment. It's the entire point of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short runs. Instant Death.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most runs last under 30 seconds. If you hit something - you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three speed classes.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skill across three speed classes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLOW</strong> - Plenty of time to react and learn the tracks. You can keep the boost pressed the whole way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPER</strong> - The boost gets serious. You can still probably hold it the entire run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERDRIVE</strong> - Speedrunner territory. Insanely fast. If you can't hyperfocus and stay fully locked in, it's not for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/0562a22fd44124e836677238c8388144.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insane skill ceiling.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you can hold the boost the entire run. Good. You can still go faster:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grazing</strong> - near misses give you extra speed. The more you risk, the bigger the return.<br><strong>Smoothness</strong> - turning scrubs speed. Carve clean lines and keep the speed you've earned. <br><strong>The Line</strong> - use the cylinder's curvature to find the shortest path and shave off milliseconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/4c8fcd286915c00ea52751d3b720aa05.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Global leaderboards. Ghost replays.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just got Gold after 30 runs on the same track. Then you check the leaderboard - the world record is five seconds faster than your time. You load its Ghost Replay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know you can do better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One more run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows the track. Randomized runs mean your 200 hours don't guarantee a win against someone with 2 - whoever survives furthest takes the race. Up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/e4f311f21b0d5c4340408ad2672b71ad.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No speed limit.</strong> Most racing games cap your top speed. Not this one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A track that wraps 360°.</strong> Slits come from every angle. Your &quot;ground&quot; is the entire tube.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three speed classes.</strong> From &quot;I can see what's coming&quot; to &quot;I'm one with the track now.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer.</strong> Race up to 8 players on randomized tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medal tiers and global leaderboards.</strong> The world record is waiting for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short runs, deep ceiling.</strong> Easy to start. Designed to keep getting better the more you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychedelic voxel aesthetic.</strong> Designed to look as fast as it feels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hyperfocus by design.</strong> The speed leaves you no choice - lock into flow, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psytrance soundtrack.</strong> Powerful  pumpy music that matches the speed of the race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychedelic hyper-speed racer with no speed limit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pilot an insanely fast ship  around a cosmic cylinder. There's no speed limit - only your ability to stay focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No brakes. No speed limit.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game about slowing down. It's about going faster. There are no brakes. Brakes are boring. <br><br>But there is a boost button. It's free to use, and it's always on the table. <br><br>Going faster isn't a punishment. It's the entire point of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.webm?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/d4be591ff0c7cdf1b3b1aaed8731819e.mp4?t=1788765568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Short runs. Instant Death.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most runs last under 30 seconds. If you hit something - you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a873184289be9e20016.poster.avif?t=1788765568\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633120/extras/140a3b9b381d7a8